Output demo.gif

Set Shell cmd
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1000
Set Height 600
Set Theme Dracula
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Type "ironbridge --version"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "ironbridge --help"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "ironbridge harvest scan"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "ironbridge sync --pull --dry-run"
Enter
Sleep 5s
